@format 1
@id preview.play
@title Start playback
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Playback is running and cursor ticks are emitted.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related preview.open-media
@tag playback
@tag play

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[input] Start playback request <input>
- Receive the active workspace command @ viewer.PViewerPlay(...)
> guard

[guard] Check preview readiness <decision>
- Confirm that viewer commands are enabled and a player exists @ viewer.PViewerPlay(...)
? "Preview is ready" > apply
? "Preview is unavailable" > unchanged

[apply] Apply playback state <process>
- Start Flyleaf playback and the preview clock @ viewer.PViewerPlay(...)
> result

[result] Playback synchronized <output>
=Playback is running and cursor ticks are emitted.

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Playback state is unchanged.
